@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@token = replace-with-disposable-login-token

### Health and API description
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Login: use only fictional seed accounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"cliente-a","password":"LabClienteA2026!"}

### Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Search (ordinary baseline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=demo

### Product detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### Missing product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999999

### Create product: use seller/admin bearer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Producto sintético","description":"Solo laboratorio","priceCents":12500}

### Update product: replace ID with newly created product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Producto actualizado","description":"Solo laboratorio","priceCents":15000}

### Delete newly created product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/comments

### Persist ordinary comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"Comentario ficticio para la práctica."}

### Own cart: use client bearer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Seed cart A
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add line
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":3,"quantity":1}

### Update seed line A
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### Remove seed line A
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cartId":1}

### Own orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Seed order A
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quantity update of seed order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### Admin: normal client JWT is forbidden; admin JWT succeeds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Local collector: 204 only with explicit Red Team configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/lab/collect
